v>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t</section>\n\n\n\n</aside>\n\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p></blockquote>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\">Description</span></h2>\n<p>The Gift of Eggness is a limited-time item that used to be purchasable at <a href=\"/wiki/Eggstatic_Hop_Shop\" title=\"Eggstatic Hop Shop\">Eggstatic Hop Shop</a> for 200 <a href=\"/wiki/Eggs\" title=\"Eggs\">Eggs</a> as part of Version 1.5.0 (2023 Easter Event). Once unwrapped, it contains the Eg.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Appearance\">Appearance</span></h2>\n<p>The Gift of Eggness is tall compared to the <a href=\"/wiki/Gift_Of_Alpha_Uncertainty\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Gift Of Alpha Uncertainty\">Gift Of Alpha Uncertainty</a> and has a lilac color with red-violet polka dots topped with a white ribbon. \n</p><p>The Eg is an egg with a smily face and two wobbly legs that keeps on wobbling uncontrollably. It's a reference to game called \"Eg\"\n</p>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260902225314\nCache expiry: 1209600\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.035 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.043 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 72/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 416/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 6/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 5/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 28/5000000 bytes\nLua time usage: 0.006/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 1019484/104857600 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   35.750      1 -total\n 95.40%   34.107      1 Template:Objects\n  4.40%    1.572      1 Template:Trade-only\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key 1.43.9_prod_oaklands:pcache:idhash:1368-0!sseVary=RegularPage!FandomDesktop!LegacyGalleries and timestamp 20260902225314 and revision id 11229. Rendering was triggered because: page-view\n -->\n</div>","categories":["Items","Limited","Gi